  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Authority",
      "items": [
        "Human 保留最终主权；Architect authority 来自 current durable delegation，不来自工具能力。",
        "Project Architect 在项目内自治；Global 只处理跨项目、共享契约、治理冲突与优先级。",
        "Capability != Authority；merge / deploy / destructive action 分开判断。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Reading discipline",
      "items": [
        "执行/恢复先读 L0 Kernel，再由 Routing Catalog 按 role + scene targeted 展开。",
        "document exists != every Agent must read it；Research/History/ADR 默认 L3 跳过，遇到 ARCH-0 / 外部集成才按源指针读取。",
        "图是下一跳索引，不是让 Agent 递归通读整个治理仓。",
        "重大新领域：Architect 按 ARCH-0 先调研并裁决路线，Foreman 执行已授权 Work；各图节点 source[] 指向下一跳 canonical 文档。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Reliability loop",
      "items": [
        "Git/GitHub 持久化 Work、exact head、review 与 evidence；聊天/本地现场默认只是 working cache。",
        "Agent Interface 负责施工；Durable Trace 负责恢复证据；Recovery 负责从 current durable state 接续。",
        "evidence > self-report；current live facts > stale snapshot / chat memory。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Boundary",
      "items": [
        "ai-use 拥有可复用治理/协议，不拥有部署实例的项目实时状态、节点 runtime 或业务事实。",
        "Human Host / Diagram / GitHub Native 都是 targeted protocol，不自动提升为 Kernel。",
        "本图为 DERIVED；任何冲突都回 canonical source 修图，不反向修改 truth 来迁就图。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "2026-11-08 capability & evidence status (snapshot)",
      "items": [
        "MERGED: Issue 主题收敛规范 PR #185；Fresh Architect 完成 BOOT 后做定向整理，不是第四个启动 gate。",
        "MERGED SOURCE ONLY: agent-runtime OpenCode 参考源码；首次 OCI/GHCR package 仍未正式发布。",
        "OPEN / NOT MAIN: 公共 OCI Supply PR #182、Worksite Log PR #174、软件架构/图示门禁 PR #178；跨执行器案例 PR #184 仍为 Draft；以 GitHub live PR 为准。",
        "GAP / EXTERNAL OWNER: Change-aware Work Graph 的契约变更影响传播尚未实装；不得把 Issue 依赖筛选或 Archify 展示误称自动重规划。"
      ]
    }
  ]
